[1mWhere I looked for divergence.[22m The program has ten branch edges, all in [38;5;10mmain[0m and [38;5;10mparse_val[0m, and every side of each is now covered. The risky spots were:[0m[0m
[0m[0m
- The 99-byte [38;5;10mfgets[0m window — tested from both sides (98 chars + [38;5;10m\n[0m, 99 chars + [38;5;10m\n[0m where the newline goes unread, [38;5;10m"1"*120[0m truncating into an [38;5;10mERANGE[0m error, 200 spaces pushing the digits out of the window).[0m[0m
