- Embedded NUL bytes, which [38;5;10mfgets[0m copies but [38;5;10mstrtol[0m treats as a terminator.[0m[0m
- [38;5;10mstrtol[0m's acceptance of trailing garbage: [38;5;10m"12abc"[0m, [38;5;10m"0x10"[0m, [38;5;10m"1e5"[0m, [38;5;10m"4.9"[0m all [3msucceed[23m because [38;5;10mparse_val[0m only checks [38;5;10mendp != str[0m.[0m[0m
- [38;5;10mERANGE[0m and the [38;5;10mint[0m-range check as two distinct rejections that print the same message.[0m[0m
- Signed overflow of [38;5;10mbedrooms +=[0m across the two [38;5;10mrun[0m calls on the same house ([38;5;10m5 → -2147483644 → 3[0m for [38;5;10mINT_MAX[0m). I rebuilt the C both unoptimized and at [38;5;10m-O3[0m to confirm gcc doesn't exploit the UB differently.[0m[0m
[0m[0m
